@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+Fixed creation of the base temporary directory used by ``tmpdir``, ``tmpdir_factory`` and ``tmp_path_factory`` when the current user name returned by ``getpass.getuser()`` contains characters which are not allowed in directory names, such as the backslash in Windows domain user names (e.g. ``contoso\john_doe``).
